body:
@ValWood Why biosynthesis and catabolism don't work for the serine racemase? 

I suggest annotating the racemase to D-serine biosynthetic process (and not use any catabolic process for the L-serine in this case)

How else does [D-serine biosynthetic process](http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0070179) happen ?
